  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DoctorHelp.NpcDialogueAsset
  content: 'Hello, doctor.

    My head is throbbing and I feel sick to my stomach.

    I hurt my arm when a cart knocked me over.

    I think I should have taken yesterday off.'
